    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vacp2p/zerokit/tarball/nightly",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vacp2p/zerokit/zipball/nightly",
    "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore(deps): bump the actions group with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/431\n* chore(deps): bump docker/login-action from 4.5.2 to 4.6.0 in the actions group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/434\n* nix: bump release-25.11 rev to pick up fetch-cargo-vendor-util-v2, and update cargoHash for v3.0.0 by @richard-ramos in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/435\n* feat: extended round parameters for PoseidonHash by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/433\n* nix: add mingw nix package by @dlipicar in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/438\n* feat: poseidon2 implementation and benchmark by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/437\n\n## New Contributors\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/431\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/compare/v3.0.0...nightly",
    "mentions_count": 4
  },
