    ],
    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vacp2p/zerokit/tarball/v3.0.0",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vacp2p/zerokit/zipball/v3.0.0",
    "body": "## Highlights\r\n\r\nv3.0.0 is a full redesign of zerokit's internals, public API, and FFI/WASM boundaries. The headline change is that **mode selection moved from compile-time feature flags to runtime and type-level configuration**.\r\nThere are no longer `stateless`, `multi-message-id`, or tree-backend cargo features: state is now a type-state on `RLN<State, ZkProof>` (`Stateful<T>` / `Stateless`), the tree backend is a plain type parameter (`FullMerkleTree`, `OptimalMerkleTree`, `PmTree`), and single vs. multi message-id is a runtime enum on `RLNWitnessInput` / `RLNProofValues`.\r\n\r\nThe `RLN` object is constructed through a builder (`RLNBuilder::stateful(tree)` / `RLNBuilder::stateless()`), witnesses are built with typed builders (`RLNWitnessInput::new_single()` / `new_multi()`), serialization is unified behind a single `Serialize`/`Deserialize` trait family in `protocol/serialize.rs`, and the FFI surface was rewritten against the new API. \r\n\r\nThis is a breaking release for every downstream consumer.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* refactor(PR 0): add message mode and remove multi message id flag by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/403\r\n* refactor(PR 4): implement all stateless RLN features by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/410\r\n* refactor(PR 5): implement missing stateless features and rln-wasm module by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/411\r\n* refactor(PR 6): implement stateful features, remove witness calc from JS, add new serialize trait and partial proof to rln-wasm by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/414\r\n* refactor(PR 7): cleanup old error type, redesign str-keyed map with CalcWitness/CalcWitnessPartial traits by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/416\r\n* refactor(PR 8): implement Builder pattern for RLNV3 type using external crate (bon) and update rln-cli module by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/417\r\n* refactor(PR 9): new V3 impl for FFI, migrate FFI/WASM utils to serialize trait and split and standardize C/Nim/JS examples by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/418\r\n* release(v3.0.0): full redesign of zerokit's public API, internals and FFI/WASM boundaries by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/428\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/compare/v2.0.1...v3.0.0",
    "mentions_count": 1
  },
