    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vacp2p/zerokit/tarball/v2.0.0",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vacp2p/zerokit/zipball/v2.0.0",
    "body": "# Zerokit v2.0.0 Release Notes\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\nZerokit v2.0.0 introduces two major features: **multi-message-id support** for consuming multiple message-ID units in a single proof, and **Groth16 partial proof generation** for accelerated proof creation by caching the static witness portion. This release also adds a version byte to all serialized structures, improved input validation, and significantly expanded test coverage.\r\n\r\n## What's New\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n- **Multi-message-id support** (`feat`): allows consuming multiple message-ID units in a single RLN proof, enabling flexible rate limiting with the `multi-message-id` feature flag (#375)\r\n- **Groth16 partial proof generation** (`feat`): pre-compute and cache the static witness portion, then quickly finish proofs for new messages — significantly reducing proof generation latency for repeated operations (#373)\r\n- **Version byte serialization**: all serialized structures (RLNPartialWitnessInput, PartialProof) now include a version byte prefix for forward compatibility\r\n- **Input validation for bytes-to-field conversion**: validates input when converting bytes to field elements, preventing invalid inputs from silently producing incorrect results (#387)\r\n- **Improved graph initialization**: deserialize circuit graph only once during initialization for faster startup (#368)\r\n- **Pull request template** for standardized contributions (#377)\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed example in README, updated Cargo.lock, import cleanup (#374)\r\n\r\n### Breaking Changes\r\n- **Serialization format change**: all serialized witness and proof structures now include a version byte prefix (0x00 for single message-id, 0x01 for multi-message-id). Existing serialized data without the version byte will fail to deserialize.\r\n- **New circuit resources**: added new tree_depth_10 and  updated tree_depth_20 (with multi_message_id/max_out_4 subdirectories). \r\n- **Refactored witness/proof types**: RLNWitnessInput and RLNProofValues have been combined from separate struct and enum variants into unified types (#462714)\r\n\r\n### Test Coverage\r\n- Extensive new test coverage for protocol and circuit modules (#372)\r\n- Serialization FFI error cases (#376)\r\n- RLN-WASM bindings error cases (#381)\r\n- Overflow panic potential coverage (#382)\r\n- Merkle invalid proof and PM tree coverage (#367)\r\n- Rate-limit validation and resource error tests (#365)\r\n- RLN proof verification failure cases (#363)\r\n- Test coverage report added to CI (#371)\r\n\r\n## Version Matrix\r\n\r\n| Crate | Version |\r\n|-------|---------|\r\n| rln | 2.0.0 |\r\n| zerokit_utils | 1.1.0 |\r\n| rln-wasm | 2.0.0 |\r\n| rln-cli | 0.6.0 |\r\n\r\n## Full Changelog\r\n* test: RLN proof verification failure cases by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/363\r\n* chore: update Cargo.lock for rln and version of circom-witnesscalc by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/364\r\n* feat(rln): improve graph initialization by deserialize only once by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/368\r\n* test: Rate-limit validation and resource error tests  by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/365\r\n* test: Merkle invalid proof and PM tree coverage tests by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/367\r\n* chore: Test coverage report for CI by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/371\r\n* chore: fix example in Readme, update Cargo.lock, cleanup import by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/374\r\n* test: Improve coverage for protocol and circuit modules by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/372\r\n* feat(docs): provide pull request template by @seemenkina in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/377\r\n* bump nixpkgs to a 25.11 commit by @Ivansete-status in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/378\r\n* test: RLN-WASM bindings error cases by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/381\r\n* test: Serialization FFI error cases by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/376\r\n* feat(rln): validate the input for conversion from bytes to field elements by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/387\r\n* Ark groth16 partial by @mghazwi in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/373\r\n* feat: implement multi-message-id feature by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/375\r\n* test: Cover code with potential to overflow panic by @romanzac in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/382\r\n* chore: updated circom-rln repo link, add partial proof to rln-cli example and FFI examples by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/390\r\n* feat: updated doc and example about using old partial proof by @vinhtc27 in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/393\r\n* chore: update dependencies and version numbers across multiple crates by @seemenkina in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/392\r\n* fix(rln): exclude large resource files from crate package by @seemenkina in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/394\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @romanzac made their first contribution in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/363\r\n* @Ivansete-status made their first contribution in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/378\r\n* @mghazwi made their first contribution in https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/pull/373\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/compare/v1.0.0...v2.0.0",
    "discussion_url": "https://github.com/vacp2p/zerokit/discussions/395",
    "mentions_count": 5
  }
]
